config MEGUMINLINK_USB_SUPPORT
    bool "Enable USB (TinyUSB) support"
    default y
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
    help
        Compile the USB/TinyUSB support code (main/usb.cc). The USB OTG
        peripheral is only available on ESP32-S3, so this option is only
        configurable when building for that target; on other targets the
        file is always excluded from the build.
